@guide Both_UngoroCrater
@name Un'Goro Crater
@faction Both
@levels 48-52
@zone Un'Goro Crater
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Marshal's Refuge and the neutral crater quests: pylons, devilsaurs, oozes, raptors, the gorillas and Linken.
@next A_Felwood [faction=Alliance]
@next H_Felwood [faction=Horde]

accept Crystals of Power | J.D. Collie.
accept Expedition Salvation | Williden Marshal, Marshal's Refuge.
accept Alien Ecology | Hol'anyee Marshal.
accept Roll the Bones | Spark Nilminer.
accept Shizzle's Flyer | Shizzle, Marshal's Refuge.
accept Muigin and Larion [faction=Alliance] | Muigin, Marshal's Refuge.
accept Larion and Muigin [faction=Horde] | Larion, Marshal's Refuge.
accept Beware of Pterrordax | The sign on the ramp down into the crater.
accept The Apes of Un'Goro | Torwa Pathfinder at the east side of the crater.
accept The Fare of Lar'korwi
fp Marshal's Refuge
complete The Fare of Lar'korwi | The threshadon carcass is near Torwa.
turnin The Fare of Lar'korwi
accept The Scent of Lar'korwi
complete Beware of Pterrordax | Pterrordaxes and Frenzied Pterrordaxes.
complete Expedition Salvation | Supply crates around the crater.
complete Alien Ecology | Use the gorishi scent gland on the hive at the Slithering Scar (southwest).
complete Roll the Bones | Dinosaur bones on the ground.
complete Crystals of Power | Power crystals in the crater.
complete Shizzle's Flyer | Webbed scales from Young Diemetradons and Fledgling Pterrordaxes around the crater.
complete Muigin and Larion [faction=Alliance] | Bloodpetals from Bloodpetal Lashers, Trappers and Flayers.
complete Larion and Muigin [faction=Horde] | Bloodpetal Lashers, Trappers and Flayers.
complete The Scent of Lar'korwi | Raptor nests near the Terror Run.
turnin The Scent of Lar'korwi
accept The Bait for Lar'korwi
complete The Bait for Lar'korwi [group=2] | Lar'korwi's Head drops from Lar'korwi.
turnin The Bait for Lar'korwi
complete The Apes of Un'Goro | Un'Goro gorillas north-east.
turnin The Apes of Un'Goro
turnin Beware of Pterrordax
turnin Roll the Bones
turnin Alien Ecology
turnin Expedition Salvation
turnin Crystals of Power
turnin Shizzle's Flyer
turnin Muigin and Larion [faction=Alliance]
turnin Larion and Muigin [faction=Horde]
accept The Northern Pylon | Escort quest: start it when you are ready to follow.
accept The Eastern Pylon | Escort quest: start it when you are ready to follow.
accept The Western Pylon | Escort quest: start it when you are ready to follow.
complete The Northern Pylon | Escort: stay close; it fails if the NPC dies.
complete The Eastern Pylon | Escort: stay close; it fails if the NPC dies.
complete The Western Pylon | Escort: stay close; it fails if the NPC dies.
turnin The Northern Pylon
turnin The Eastern Pylon
turnin The Western Pylon
accept Making Sense of It
turnin Making Sense of It
level 51
accept Finding the Source | Needs level 51. Krakle, at the hot springs on the west side of Fire Plume Ridge.
complete Finding the Source | Use Krakle's Thermometer at the hottest vent up on Fire Plume Ridge.
turnin Finding the Source
train
note Alliance: fly to Talonbranch Glade (Felwood). Horde: fly to Bloodvenom Post (Felwood).
